            <div xml:id="d74-a13">

                <pb facs="0216" n="120" sameAs="frus:frus1872p1/pg120"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure N.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Important letter from the Hon. J. P. Root to Santiago
                        medical students.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1872-07-24"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 24,
                        1872</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Saturday</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">August</hi> 10, 1872.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Honorable Sir</hi>: Grateful for the zeal and
                    self-denial you have manifested, as well in the hospitals as in private toward
                    our unfortunate countrymen; and desirous likewise of co-operating in the early
                    extinction of the epidemic, we take the liberty of requesting you to be so good
                    as to put us in possession of your professional observations with regard to the
                    disease, accompanied with the well-devised and successful method of treatment
                    which your knowledge has suggested to you.</p>
                <p>We, mere beginners in the medical career, hope to second the efforts you have
                    made for the extirpation of the disease, availing ourselves of the scientific
                    information you may be so good as to provide us with, on which account the
                    victims of the epidemic, as well as your attentive admirers and friends, will
                    remain eternally obliged.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <list>
                            <item>JACINTO O DEL RIO.</item>
                            <item>ERNESTO TURENNE.</item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>The Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">J. P. Root</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Present.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
